      "rationale": "Don-dɔnbagni tɔgɔw: metsiltayim (dual — dɔnbagni fila), nebal ani kinor bɛ sɛbɛn Heburu-tiɲɛ la, fɔko-fɔlɔ la ɲɛfɔli-faralen ye"
