      "rationale": "בוץ ye lin-nafama fitiri ye; Bamanankan tɛ tɔgɔ kelen sɔrɔ, nka 'lin fitiri' ka ɲi"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Lewiyenw, donkilibagaw, bɛɛ: Asaf, Heman, Yedutun, ni u denw ni u balimaw, u donna lin fitiri na, ni metsiltayim (dɔnbagni-fila), nebal ani kinor, u jonginna sarakabɔlan tilebin fɛ; ni u ye sarakalasebagaw kɛmɛ ni nɛgɛsɔn fila minnu bɛ ka kanbila di.",
